<span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">), and </span></span></span><i>Barbe Bleue</i><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"> (</span></span></span><i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bluebeard\" target=\"_blank\">Bluebeard</a></i><span style=\"color:#252525\"><span style=\"font-family:sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">). Google even made <a href=\"http://www.google.com/doodles/charles-perraults-388th-birthday\" target=\"_blank\">special Doodle</a> for this occasion.</span></span></span><br /> <br /> Would this character be somehow connected to the Lost, when his stories are all so similar to many of Seemings and Kiths motiffs? Maybe he was <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">Ensorcel</span></span>led on Paris Seasonal Court?<br /> <br /> <img src=\"http://www.google.com/logos/doodles/2016/charles-perraults-388th-birthday-5071286030041088-hp2x.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-13T02:34:35-08:00","id":807736,"title":"","content":"He indirectly made half the basis for the modern Paris freehold, the Rosi\u00e8re, with his classic staple telling of Little Red Riding Hood. The Rose Courts owe him a deep debt of gratitude.<br /> <br /> Oh, by the way, surprise, that's not fanon anymore. The Rose Courts are making their way into Changeling the Lost Second Edition, updated, polished